---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import Prose from '@/components/site/Prose.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy | Divaca" description="How Divaca handles information collected on this website.">
  <Prose title="Privacy" updated="27 October 2026">
    <p>This page explains what information this website collects and how Divaca uses it. It covers this website only. Individual Divaca products may have their own privacy notices.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you use a form on this site we collect what you type into it: your name, email address, your interest in a product, and any message or organisation name you choose to add.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To reply to your message or enquiry.</li>
      <li>To send you updates about the Divaca products you asked about.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell your information.</p>
    <h2>Who handles it</h2>
    <p>Form submissions are received through a third-party form service and delivered to the Divaca team. Our hosting provider also processes standard technical data such as IP addresses to serve the site.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to see, correct or delete the information you sent us by writing to us through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If we change this page we will update the date above.</p>
  </Prose>
</Layout>
